# The Timeline's three popups on examples/40-cinematic (ADR 0204): a track
# being added, a key's own menu, and the prompt a line's key is named in.
# Coordinates are a 1600 by 900 frame's.
wait 60
click 170 106
wait 4
text Meeting
wait 12
click 132 155
wait 8
key ctrl+shift+p
wait 8
text Timeline
wait 8
key enter
wait 30
click 900 650
wait 8
shot timeline-add-track
click 600 45
wait 6
rclick 599 709
wait 8
shot timeline-key-menu
click 600 45
wait 6
click 65 736
wait 8
shot timeline-key-name
quit
